  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Team Up prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 19–20 and 26–27 January 2019, and sold in shops from 15 February 2019. Each box held four Team Up booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Team Up logo. The packs also held a non-holo Erika's Hospitality, a card that is holofoil in booster packs.",
